-- Seeds the 90-row / 30-day Instagram + Facebook launch calendar into
-- social_content_queue. Format/theme/caption/image_search_term come
-- directly from the calendar's Format/Theme/Caption/"Visual Direction"
-- columns -- image_search_term is fed to social-image-fetch, which
-- resolves it to a real Wikimedia Commons photo at post time, not at
-- insert time (so this migration never touches image URLs).
on conflict (day_number, slot_number) do nothing;
